	measure Combined_MTD_Sales_and_RunRate = ```
			
			VAR FirstSlicerDate = MIN(RunRateDateSlicer[Date])
			VAR FirstMonthStart = DATE(YEAR(FirstSlicerDate), MONTH(FirstSlicerDate), 1)
			VAR FirstMonthEnd = EOMONTH(FirstSlicerDate, 0)
			
			VAR SecondMonthStart = EOMONTH(FirstSlicerDate, 0) + 1
			VAR SecondMonthEnd = EOMONTH(FirstSlicerDate, 1)
			
			VAR CurrentDate = MAX(DateTableToday[Date])
			VAR CurrentMonthStart = DATE(YEAR(CurrentDate), MONTH(CurrentDate), 1)
			
			VAR IsFirstMonth = CurrentMonthStart = FirstMonthStart
			VAR IsSecondMonth = CurrentMonthStart = SecondMonthStart
			
			RETURN
			SWITCH(
			    TRUE(),
			    IsFirstMonth, [ActualSales_FromMonthStart_ToSelectedDate],
			    IsSecondMonth, [ActualSales_FromMonthStart_ToSelectedDate] + [RunRate_MTD_LastMonth_SRR],
			    [RunRate_MTD_LastMonth_SRR]
			)
			
			```
		lineageTag: c7e9ff55-c8dc-4b6a-80c9-0a95536cba6a

